<title>USA: Cagle's FY97 revs up, net and share down.</title>
<headline>Cagle's FY97 revs up, net and share down.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>52 Wks Ended	   52 Wks Ended</p>
<p>				    Mar 29, 1997	   Mar 30, 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			    $353,073		 $308,749</p>
<p> Net Income				2,039		    8,700</p>
<p> Per Common Share			  .41		     1.73</p>
<p> Wtd average shares outstanding    5,006		    5,018</p>
<p>NOTES: The company said record high prices for feed grain throughout much of the year hurt operating margins and were offset slightly by $2.5 million recovery recognized as a reduction of cost of sales from its business interruption insurance claim.</p>
<p>Full company name is Cagle's Inc.</p>
</text>
